FemVoice Studio (Avalonia desktop preview)
==========================================

This package is a display-only, cross-platform desktop preview of FemVoice Studio.

Runtime requirement (framework-dependent)
------------------------------------------
This is a framework-dependent build. It does NOT bundle or install .NET. A
compatible .NET 10 desktop runtime must already be installed on the system and
the "dotnet" command must be on PATH. If it is not, running "femvoice-studio"
prints a clear message and exits without starting.

Launching
---------
  femvoice-studio            # start the desktop preview
  femvoice-studio --smoke    # headless self-check (verifies shared services resolve)

The /usr/bin/femvoice-studio launcher runs:
  dotnet /opt/femvoice-studio/FemVoice.Avalonia.dll

Not enabled in this preview
---------------------------
Real microphone capture, data persistence, report export, support-package
generation, backup/restore, SmartCoach/progression updates, and clinical
safety-gate / voice-health enforcement are NOT enabled in this Avalonia preview.
